<title>VENEZUELA: Ceramica Carabobo yr net surges.</title>
<headline>Ceramica Carabobo yr net surges.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 1.8 bln bolivars vs 582 million bolivars</p>
<p>Sales 47.3 bln bolivars vs 47.7 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Cost of sales 34.5 bln bolivars vs cost 37.6 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Operating costs 6.5 bln bolivars vs cost 6.8 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Financial costs 594 million bolivars vs gain 3.1 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Other costs 2.2 bln bolivars vs 4.1 bln bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Period ends September 30.</p>
<p>Results are inflation-adjusted.</p>
<p>Ceramica Carabobo SACA is a Venezuelan ceramics manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
